 {
  "id": "transfer-learning",
  "after": "commonMistakes",
  "title": "Transfer learning: borrow the eyes, train a new head.",
  "caption": "A ResNet-18 trained on ImageNet already knows edges, textures, shapes and parts. Keep those 11.2 million learned numbers frozen (locked), and swap the 1,000-class head (the last layer) for a new one for your classes. Now you train only 1,026 numbers, which a few hundred photos can do. Later you can unfreeze the last block and train it gently: that is fine-tuning.",
  "alt": "Two rows of blocks. The top row is a model pretrained on 1.28 million ImageNet photos, with blocks for edges, texture, shapes and parts, and a dashed 1,000-class head marked thrown away. An arrow says copy what it learned. The bottom row has the same four blocks with lock icons, and a new head for ripe and unripe; text says the frozen 11.2 million numbers are reused as they are, and only the new head's 1,026 numbers are trained. A note says that later you can unfreeze block 4 and train it gently.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 320\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"16\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">1. Pretrained on ImageNet</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"41\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">1.28 million photos, 1,000 classes</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"54\" width=\"56\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">edges</text><rect x=\"77\" y=\"54\" width=\"56\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"105\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">texture</text><rect x=\"138\" y=\"54\" width=\"56\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"166\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">shapes</text><rect x=\"199\" y=\"54\" width=\"56\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"227\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">parts</text><line x1=\"258\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"264\" y2=\"76\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"269,76 263,79.3 263,72.7\" class=\"f-muted\"/><rect x=\"272\" y=\"54\" width=\"72\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-bad-soft s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"308\" y=\"73\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">1,000</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"89\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">classes</text><line x1=\"135.5\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"135.5\" y2=\"139\" class=\"s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"135.5,146 131.1,138 139.9,138\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><text x=\"125.5\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"end\">copy what</text><text x=\"125.5\" y=\"137\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"end\">it learned</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-bad\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">thrown away</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">2. Your model: 200 photos per class</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"184\" width=\"56\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface2 s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M 40.0 195 v -2.5 a 4 4 0 0 1 8 0 v 2.5\" class=\"f-none s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"38\" y=\"195\" width=\"12\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1.5\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">edges</text><rect x=\"77\" y=\"184\" width=\"56\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface2 s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M 101.0 195 v -2.5 a 4 4 0 0 1 8 0 v 2.5\" class=\"f-none s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"99\" y=\"195\" width=\"12\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1.5\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"105\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">texture</text><rect x=\"138\" y=\"184\" width=\"56\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface2 s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M 162.0 195 v -2.5 a 4 4 0 0 1 8 0 v 2.5\" class=\"f-none s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"195\" width=\"12\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1.5\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"166\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">shapes</text><rect x=\"199\" y=\"184\" width=\"56\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface2 s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M 223.0 195 v -2.5 a 4 4 0 0 1 8 0 v 2.5\" class=\"f-none s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"221\" y=\"195\" width=\"12\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1.5\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"227\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">parts</text><rect x=\"195\" y=\"180\" width=\"64\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-none s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><line x1=\"261\" y1=\"209\" x2=\"264\" y2=\"209\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"269,209 263,212.3 263,205.7\" class=\"f-ok\"/><rect x=\"272\" y=\"184\" width=\"72\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"308\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">ripe</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">unripe</text><text x=\"135.5\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">frozen: 11.2 million</text><text x=\"135.5\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">numbers reused as they are</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-ok\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">new head</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1,026 numbers</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"296\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-none s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"308\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">Optional later: unfreeze block 4, train gently</text></svg>"
 },
 {
  "id": "flip-trap",
  "after": "commonMistakes",
  "title": "Augmentation must not change the answer.",
  "caption": "A left-right flip (पलटना, palatna) turns a \"No Left Turn\" sign into a picture of a right turn. But the photo keeps its old label, so the model learns something false. Small turns, brightness changes and crops keep the meaning, so they are safe for signs.",
  "alt": "Top: a No Left Turn sign, a red ring with a black arrow turning left and a red slash, labelled correct. A red arrow marked left-right flip leads to the mirrored sign, whose arrow now turns right; it is still labelled No Left Turn, which is wrong. Bottom: three safe changes of the same sign: turned 10 degrees, with a brightness change, and cropped closer. All three are still No Left Turn.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 332\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"16\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">A flip that changes the answer</text><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"84\" r=\"36\" class=\"f-surface s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"5.8\"/><path d=\"M 78 106 V 82 Q 78 74 70 74 H 58\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><polygon points=\"48,74 61,66.8 61,81.2\" class=\"f-ink\"/><line x1=\"45.5\" y1=\"59.5\" x2=\"94.5\" y2=\"108.5\" class=\"s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"5.8\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">No Left Turn</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-ok\" text-anchor=\"middle\">label: correct</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"214\" y2=\"84\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"222,84 213,89 213,79\" class=\"f-bad\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-bad\" text-anchor=\"middle\">left-right flip</text><g transform=\"translate(540 0) scale(-1 1)\"><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"84\" r=\"36\" class=\"f-surface s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"5.8\"/><path d=\"M 278 106 V 82 Q 278 74 270 74 H 258\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><polygon points=\"248,74 261,66.8 261,81.2\" class=\"f-ink\"/><line x1=\"245.5\" y1=\"59.5\" x2=\"294.5\" y2=\"108.5\" class=\"s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"5.8\"/></g><text x=\"270\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-bad\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">label: No Left Turn</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">but it shows a right turn</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"344\" y2=\"178\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"202\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Safe changes: the answer stays the same</text><g transform=\"rotate(10 62 252)\"><circle cx=\"62\" cy=\"252\" r=\"26\" class=\"f-surface s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"4.2\"/><path d=\"M 67.8 267.9 V 250.6 Q 67.8 244.8 62 244.8 H 53.3\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"3.6\"/><polygon points=\"46.1,244.8 55.5,239.6 55.5,249.9\" class=\"f-ink\"/><line x1=\"44.3\" y1=\"234.3\" x2=\"79.7\" y2=\"269.7\" class=\"s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"4.2\"/></g><text x=\"62\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">turn 10°</text><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"252\" r=\"26\" class=\"f-surface s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"4.2\"/><path d=\"M 185.8 267.9 V 250.6 Q 185.8 244.8 180 244.8 H 171.3\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"3.6\"/><polygon points=\"164.1,244.8 173.5,239.6 173.5,249.9\" class=\"f-ink\"/><line x1=\"162.3\" y1=\"234.3\" x2=\"197.7\" y2=\"269.7\" class=\"s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"4.2\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"252\" r=\"30\" class=\"f-ink\" fill-opacity=\"0.28\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">brightness</text><defs><clipPath id=\"l3cv-crop\"><rect x=\"272\" y=\"222\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" rx=\"4\"/></clipPath></defs><g clip-path=\"url(#l3cv-crop)\"><circle cx=\"312\" cy=\"260\" r=\"40\" class=\"f-surface s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"6.4\"/><path d=\"M 320.9 284.4 V 257.8 Q 320.9 248.9 312 248.9 H 298.7\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"5.6\"/><polygon points=\"287.6,248.9 302,240.9 302,256.8\" class=\"f-ink\"/><line x1=\"284.8\" y1=\"232.8\" x2=\"339.2\" y2=\"287.2\" class=\"s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"6.4\"/></g><rect x=\"272\" y=\"222\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-none s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"302\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">crop</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"322\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-ok\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">All three: still No Left Turn</text></svg>"
 },
 {
  "id": "bgr-rgb",
  "after": "commonMistakes",
  "title": "OpenCV says B, G, R; matplotlib reads R, G, B.",
  "caption": "OpenCV stores each pixel's colours in the order blue, green, red. matplotlib reads the same three cells as red, green, blue, so red and blue swap places on screen: red chillies look blue. One cvtColor line puts them back in order. The file on disk was never wrong.",
  "alt": "A red chilli pixel is red 220, green 30, blue 40. Row 1: cv2.imread stores it as B, G, R: 40, 30, 220. Row 2: plt.imshow reads the same cells as R, G, B, so red is 40 and blue is 220, and a blue square shows it looks blue. Row 3: the fix, cv2.cvtColor with COLOR_BGR2RGB, gives R, G, B: 220, 30, 40, and a red square shows it is red again.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 334\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"16\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">One red chilli pixel in mirchi.jpg</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"34\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-sindoor\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">red 220, green 30, blue 40</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">cv2.imread stores it</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">as B, G, R</text><text x=\"218\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">B</text><rect x=\"196\" y=\"90\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"218\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" class=\"mono\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">G</text><rect x=\"240\" y=\"90\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"262\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" class=\"mono\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30</text><text x=\"306\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">R</text><rect x=\"284\" y=\"90\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"306\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"14\" class=\"mono\" text-anchor=\"middle\">220</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"344\" y2=\"132\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">plt.imshow reads</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">the same cells as R, G, B</text><text x=\"218\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">R</text><rect x=\"196\" y=\"156\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"218\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"14\" class=\"mono\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">G</text><rect x=\"240\" y=\"156\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"262\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"14\" class=\"mono\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30</text><text x=\"306\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">B</text><rect x=\"284\" y=\"156\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"306\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"14\" class=\"mono\" text-anchor=\"middle\">220</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"188\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-bad\" font-weight=\"600\">red 40, blue 220: looks blue</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"228\" x2=\"344\" y2=\"228\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">Fix first:</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"mono\">cv2.cvtColor(img, cv2.COLOR_BGR2RGB)</text><text x=\"218\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">R</text><rect x=\"196\" y=\"298\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"218\" y=\"316\" font-size=\"14\" class=\"mono\" text-anchor=\"middle\">220</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">G</text><rect x=\"240\" y=\"298\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"262\" y=\"316\" font-size=\"14\" class=\"mono\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30</text><text x=\"306\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">B</text><rect x=\"284\" y=\"298\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"306\" y=\"316\" font-size=\"14\" class=\"mono\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"300\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-sindoor\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"316\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-ok\" font-weight=\"600\">red again</text></svg>"
 },
 {
  "id": "coco-gap",
  "after": "selfCheck",
  "title": "A detector only knows the classes it learned.",
  "caption": "An imagined result, drawn by hand. A YOLO model trained on COCO finds the car and the motorbike, but it has no \"autorickshaw\" class, so the auto gets no box (or a wrong label). The fix is labelled local data: photos of autos with a box drawn round each, then fine-tuning.",
  "alt": "A sketch of a road with a blue car labelled car 0.91, a motorbike with a rider labelled motorbike 0.88, and a yellow and green autorickshaw with a dashed red outline labelled no box. Below: COCO, the training set, has 80 classes, including car, bus, truck, motorcycle and person, but lacks autorickshaw, e-rickshaw and handcart. A green box says: photograph local autos, draw boxes, then fine-tune the detector on them.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 302\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"16\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Imagined YOLO result on a Pune road</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"34\" width=\"328\" height=\"128\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"132\" width=\"328\" height=\"30\" class=\"f-muted\"/><path d=\"M 26 122 V 110 Q 26 104 34 104 L 44 92 H 74 L 86 104 H 96 Q 102 104 102 110 V 122 Z\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"123\" r=\"7\" class=\"f-ink\"/><circle cx=\"86\" cy=\"123\" r=\"7\" class=\"f-ink\"/><rect x=\"22\" y=\"86\" width=\"84\" height=\"46\" class=\"f-none s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><rect x=\"22\" y=\"66\" width=\"59.6\" height=\"19\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"51.8\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">car 0.91</text><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"124\" r=\"7\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"124\" r=\"7\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><path d=\"M 146 124 L 156 110 H 174 L 180 124\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><circle cx=\"162\" cy=\"88\" r=\"5\" class=\"f-s2\"/><rect x=\"157\" y=\"93\" width=\"10\" height=\"17\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-s2\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"80\" width=\"56\" height=\"58\" class=\"f-none s-s4\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"60\" width=\"112.2\" height=\"19\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-surface s-s4\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"186.1\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">motorcycle 0.88</text><path d=\"M 240 120 V 100 Q 240 86 254 86 H 284 Q 292 86 294 96 L 300 120 Z\" class=\"f-haldi s-ink\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"248\" y=\"94\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-surface\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"94\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-surface\"/><path d=\"M 238 120 H 302 V 128 H 238 Z\" class=\"f-ok\"/><circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"130\" r=\"7\" class=\"f-ink\"/><circle cx=\"292\" cy=\"130\" r=\"7\" class=\"f-ink\"/><rect x=\"232\" y=\"80\" width=\"78\" height=\"60\" class=\"f-none s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><rect x=\"246\" y=\"60\" width=\"52.3\" height=\"19\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-bad-soft s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"272.1\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">no box</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"186\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">COCO, the training set: 80 classes</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">has: car, bus, truck, motorcycle, person</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"226\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-bad\" font-weight=\"600\">lacks: autorickshaw, e-rickshaw, handcart</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"242\" width=\"328\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"13\">Fix: photograph local autos, draw boxes,</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"13\">then fine-tune the detector on them.</text></svg>"
 },
 {
  "id": "vit-vs-cnn",
  "after": "selfCheck",
  "title": "How a Vision Transformer looks at a photo.",
  "caption": "A CNN slides a small window and builds up from edges to shapes. A Vision Transformer cuts the photo into patches and turns each into a token: the photo's version of a word, stored as a list of numbers. It also adds each patch's position. Then attention lets every patch compare itself with every other, from the very first layer. Only a 4 × 4 grid is drawn; the usual ViT setup cuts a 224 × 224 photo into 196 patches.",
  "alt": "Two tomato photos side by side. Left, CNN: a small yellow window in the corner with arrows sliding right and down; text says small window slides, edges first, then shapes. Right, Vision Transformer: the same photo cut into a 4 by 4 grid of patches. Below, the patches sit in a row as numbered tokens 1 to 16, with curved yellow lines from token 1 to the others; text says every patch is compared with every other. A note: a real ViT cuts a 224 by 224 photo into 16 by 16 patches, so 14 by 14 = 196 tokens.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 410\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"82\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">CNN</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Vision Transformer</text><rect x=\"22\" y=\"46\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"82\" cy=\"112\" r=\"40\" class=\"f-sindoor\"/><path d=\"M 76 74 l -12 -5 l 9 -1 l -2 -8 l 7 6 l 5 -8 l 3 9 l 9 -4 l -5 8 l 11 3 l -12 3 z\" class=\"f-ok\"/><rect x=\"212\" y=\"46\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"272\" cy=\"112\" r=\"40\" class=\"f-sindoor\"/><path d=\"M 266 74 l -12 -5 l 9 -1 l -2 -8 l 7 6 l 5 -8 l 3 9 l 9 -4 l -5 8 l 11 3 l -12 3 z\" class=\"f-ok\"/><rect x=\"36\" y=\"60\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-haldi-soft s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" fill-opacity=\"0.7\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"75\" class=\"s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"102,75 95,78.8 95,71.2\" class=\"f-haldi\"/><line x1=\"51\" y1=\"94\" x2=\"51\" y2=\"120\" class=\"s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"51,126 47.1,119 54.9,119\" class=\"f-haldi\"/><line x1=\"242\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"242\" y2=\"166\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" style=\"stroke:var(--surface)\"/><line x1=\"212\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"332\" y2=\"76\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" style=\"stroke:var(--surface)\"/><line x1=\"272\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"272\" y2=\"166\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" style=\"stroke:var(--surface)\"/><line x1=\"212\" y1=\"106\" x2=\"332\" y2=\"106\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" style=\"stroke:var(--surface)\"/><line x1=\"302\" y1=\"46\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"166\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" style=\"stroke:var(--surface)\"/><line x1=\"212\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"332\" y2=\"136\" class=\"s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" style=\"stroke:var(--surface)\"/><text x=\"82\" y=\"188\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">small window slides</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">edges first, then shapes</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"188\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">cut into patches</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">Patches in a row, each with its position:</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"242\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"31\" y=\"261.7\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><rect x=\"52\" y=\"242\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"67\" y=\"261.7\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><rect x=\"88\" y=\"242\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"103\" y=\"261.7\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><rect x=\"124\" y=\"242\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"139\" y=\"261.7\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"242\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"261.7\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><rect x=\"196\" y=\"242\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"211\" y=\"261.7\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><text x=\"247\" y=\"264\" font-size=\"14\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">…</text><rect x=\"268\" y=\"242\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"283\" y=\"261.7\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">16</text><path d=\"M 31 272 Q 49 296.6 67 272\" class=\"f-none s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 31 272 Q 67 305.3 103 272\" class=\"f-none s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 31 272 Q 85 313.9 139 272\" class=\"f-none s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 31 272 Q 103 322.6 175 272\" class=\"f-none s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 31 272 Q 121 331.2 211 272\" class=\"f-none s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 31 272 Q 157 348.5 283 272\" class=\"f-none s-haldi\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"308\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">tokens</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"338\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-haldi\" font-weight=\"600\">Every patch is compared with every other.</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"352\" width=\"328\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"373\" font-size=\"13\">Real ViT: 224 × 224 photo, 16 × 16 patches</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"392\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\">→ 14 × 14 = 196 tokens</text></svg>"
 }
